  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Finely chop cucumber and tomato. </p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83ef7cade9b9f0acdef9b/step-6eff6300.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Slice kernels off corn cob. Heat a large frying pan over high heat. <br>• Cook corn kernels until lightly browned, 4-5 minutes. Transfer to a large bowl. Set aside. <br>• Return frying pan to medium-high heat with a drizzle of olive oil. Cook veggie mince, breaking up with a spoon, until just browned, 4-5 minutes. <br>• Add All-American spice blend and cook, until fragrant, 1 minute.</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83ef7cade9b9f0acdef9b/step-d0d36210.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• While veggie mince is cooking, to bowl with charred corn, add cucumber, tomato and a drizzle of white wine vinegar and olive oil. Toss to combine and season with salt and pepper. <br>• Microwave mini flour tortillas on a microwave-safe plate in 10 second bursts until warmed through.</p> <p>Little cooks: Take the lead by tossing the salsa!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83ef7cade9b9f0acdef9b/step-b84d3420.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• <p>• Build tacos by filling with spiced veggie mince, Cheddar cheese and some charred corn salsa. <br>• Drizzle over BBQ mayo. Serve with any remaining salsa. Enjoy!</p> <p>Little cooks: Work your magic and add the finishing touch by drizzling over the BBQ mayo!</p>",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/67f83ef7cade9b9f0acdef9b/step-454c0c30.jpg"
    }
  ]
